window.products.push({"id":621112,"name":"Tablecloths for Dining Table, Stitching Tassels Kitchen Table Cloth, Wrinkle Free Anti-Fading Polyester Fabric Tabletop Table Cover Decoration for Par","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UJ3jJULjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ANTI-WRINKLE & ANTI-SHRINK, tablecloth combines the softness of the polyester fabric and the firming of hemp with the perfect proportion, which is more wrinkle-free and shrink-proof than cotton linen materials. And the edges are sewn finished with a tassel design adding a delicate and elegant beautiful farmhouse boho style NON-FADING, the table cloth is dyeing with new technology and high-quality dyes, new polyester fabric, good fixing effect, not easy to fade after a long time of using and washing. [does the size includes the fringe? ], EXCLUDES the tassel, the lace & fringe is about 1.7 inches. The color of the lace and tassels are yellowy cream, not solid white RECTANGLE / OBLONG 55x86 inches, fitted for 6 to 8 seats table. This tablecloth is suitable for indoor and outdoor use, patio, picnic, gardens, kitchen room, dining room, and family room, cafes, special occasions, party, Christmas holidays. Modern process adds a unique chevron pattern design to an original simple tablecloth, giving it the visual feel of a table runner, while a delicate tassel pendant makes it more vertical and elegant NOT SLIDE EASILY OFF THE TABLE SURFACE, the fabric of the tablecloth is thick, solid, and heavy, also, the four edges of the tablecloth are drooping, so you don't have to worry about it sliding off the table. Please kindly measure your table before purchasing, the size of the table cloth usually larger than the size of the table. Any problems with the size selection and the quality, please don't hesitate to contact us WASHING TIPS, hand washing can better maintain and lengthen the life of the tablecloth on account of polyester texture. Also, you can wash it with washing machine in a laundry bag with gentle mode to avoid the strong throwing; Dryer drying or lay flat to dry; these tablecloths can be easily ironed to make the table cloth more flat and compliant if necessary","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UJ3jJULjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALIBALA","source_asin":"B08RYWZW17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-621112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RYWZW17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RYWZW17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
