window.products.push({"id":621257,"name":"Ganz Personalized Mini Round Plastic Christmas Ornament; Season's Greetings","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716+wVe60-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Established by Samuel Ganz and sons Jack and Sam in 1950, this privately-held family company is now headed by the founder's grandson, Howard Ganz. Corporate Headquarters are located in Toronto, Canada, with U.S. offices in Atlanta and Los Angeles, and overseas offices in Hong Kong and Shanghai. As the story begins... shortly after WWII, Samuel Ganz made his way to New York City, while his sons Sam and Jack, settled in Toronto. On one of his visits to see them, Samuel brought along a doll he had seen produced in New York. After making a few contacts, and holding discussions, Ganz Toys was in business! Ganz Toys rose to become the premier toy company in Canada, producing high quality goods following high safety standards. When Howard joined the company, this marked the third generation of the family to be officially involved in its operation. As the firm continued to grow and evolve, the company name was changed to Ganz. Ganz established collections of giftware, tabletop accents, candles and personal care, garden decor and more. The creation of Webkinz pets and the virtual Webkinz World launched a new chapter in the development of Ganz.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716+wVe60-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ganz","source_asin":"B00PHUE806","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-621257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PHUE806","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PHUE806","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":621258,"name":"Bruntmor Premium Cast Iron 8-edges Biscuit Pan/Skillet with handle,Round Kitchen Non stick Baking Tool for Scones, Corn Stick Pan, Muffins, cup cakes ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hQgkRq8CS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Versatile 7-Cups Pan : Create the most delicious chocolate fudge, cookies, cupcake, apple pie, brownies, muffins, and scones using this pre-seasoned cast iron baking pan. The nonstick cake pop pan maker can unlock a baker's imagination. Whether you’re making early morning blueberry scones or afternoon tea biscuits, this seasoned round biscuit pan is perfect for outdoor and indoor use. Comfortable Grip Handles: The molding trays for baking biscuit pan is designed with extra-wide, easy to hold handles that offer an outstanding grip when transferring from oven to surface. The open frame design gives enough room for you to hold or hang this biscuit baking pan with ease. Even Heat Non Stick Pan: Experience superior heat distribution and retention for consistent even baking! The special design of this cast iron muffin pan has the perfect side height and thickness to evenly distribute heat making the crust evenly baked.Impress your family and friends with homemade mouthwatering baked goodies with this incredible cast iron baking pans. Scratch and Stain Resistant : Our cast iron donut baking biscuit pan is treated to a food-safe pre-seasoned finish so you can easily pop out and serve your biscuits! It’s protected with a non-stick pre-seasoned coating that doesn’t crack and emit any weird odors or smells. Also, it is also scratch-resistant. Works With All Types of Heat Sources This variety of durable pans comes in various shapes and sizes. This muffin biscuit pan makes the perfect gift for an aspiring baker. This multi-purpose brownies baking pan works with all types of heat sources. It can be used on induction, ceramic, electric and gas cooktops, in your oven, on the grill and campfire.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hQgkRq8CS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bruntmor","source_asin":"B0BKLT233R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-621258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKLT233R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKLT233R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
