window.products.push({"id":621326,"name":"Curtain Chic Chambray Seersucker Swag, Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.33,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819+7h2wE-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Seersucker and Chambray are two American traditions so why not combine them for a classic look in the traditional palette. Not to be confused with chemically produced puckers, true Seersucker can only be produced by careful weaving. Likewise, a true Chambray can't be achieved through vat dyeing; only the slower labor intense yarn-dying process will yield the subtle slubs and coloration of an authentic Chambray. Chambray Seersucker is available in a tailored valance that can stand on its own or be inserted into the tailored swag. If you'd like a little more privacy, pair with our Chambray Seersucker tiers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819+7h2wE-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Curtain Chic, Inc.","source_asin":"B00H6ZCJ92","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-621326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00H6ZCJ92","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00H6ZCJ92","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":621327,"name":"Ner Mitzvah Tree of Life Menorah Set for Hanukkah - Antiqued Hanukkah Menorah Set - Small Menora, Chanukah Candles, Dreidels, Play Coins, & Hanukkah G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818RA5GdPeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Complete Hanukkah Set! Stop the hunt here, this minorah set has it all. PRODUCT FEATURES: - Quality, Value, Price! - Safe and Sturdy - Kosher - Made with Premium Quality Materials - Durable and Designed for Long Lasting Use - Tree of life design COMPLETE MENORAH AND CANDLE SET INCLUDES - Tree of Life Menorah 6\" wide x 6.5\" High - 44 Hanukkah candles (3.7\" x 0.3\") - 5 Dreidels (wooden - gold - metallic silver - plastic colored) - Complete Menorah Lighting Guide and Dreidel game instructions - Play \"gelt\" coins LIGHT UP THE NIGHT A favorite for so many, celebrating Chanuka is a highlight of the year. Of all the holiday traditions, kindling the Jewish Menorah is the main event. Lighting the candles brings families and friends together to celebrate. Ner Mitzvah's collection of Hanukiah Menorah help you celebrate the festival right. Choose from a dazzling array of shapes, designs and colors. Whether your choice is classic or fun, vintage or modern, gold, silver, or brightly colored, Ner Mitzvah has a menora that suits your taste and style. CLASSIC HANUKKAH GIFT These tree of life decor menorahs make the perfect Chanukah gift for boys and girls, men and women. While the holiday of Chanuka lasts for 8 days a year, menorahs for chanukah have deep symbolic meaning in Jewish culture & history that renders them part of our shared consciousness. Ner Miztvah window menorah makes great Jewish themed presents all year long. ABOUT NER MITZVAH Family-operated since the 1940’s, Ner Mitzvah is an expert candle-maker, delivering a wide selection of products at the highest quality with personal customer service. Count on us for Shabbat, Havdalah, and Chanukah candles and oil lamps as well as related Judaica.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818RA5GdPeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ner Mitzvah","source_asin":"B0996CYVQ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-621327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0996CYVQ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0996CYVQ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
