window.products.push({"id":621545,"name":"CQURE Artificial Flowers,Fake Flowers Silk Flowers Wedding 10 Heads Rose Bouquets Flower Arrangement for Home Decor Party Centerpieces Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G0QiG-3yL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"CQURE stands behind all of its products. If for any reason you are not satisfied, please don't hesitate to contact our customer service for help. Size: Bunch dimension approx:30cm High.  Diameter of the rose flower:9.5cm approximately Diameter of the dihila flower: 9cm approximately Diameter of the big chrysanthemum flower: 5cm approximately Diameter of the small chrysanthemum flower:4cm approximately Package: 3 big rose buds,3 dahila buds,2 small chrysanthemum buds and 2 big chrysanthemum.Flowers only,there is no vase or other items included. Warm Tips: 1.Please note：The flowers are handmade,so there may be dropped leaves and heads or bended, it's not the quality problem of the artificial flowers, it can be installed back simply.  2.Artificial flowers may be squeezed and deformed in transit,but don't worry,the bouquet generally will be recover with slight adjustment after displaying it. You can also use boiled water to smoke deformed flowers,when bouquet get soften and wet and fold disappear,use the hair dryer with cold wind to dry it.  3.There would be accumulated dust if you put it in a place for very long time, You can use the hair dryer with cold wind to remove the dust. If it was seriously dirty,you could sink it into salt water with high concentration for 10 minutes and then add neutral detergent and then rinse twice.  4.We suggest that you don't need to wash it by hands and don't wash too frequently. It will fade if you wash it too frequently.  5.Please don't put it under strong sunshine.You'd better to dry it by the natural wind.  6.Arrangement:Best match 2 pieces bouquet in one vase.some pics look like larger size, please compare the detail sizes of exact item, please allow 1-2cm difference due to manual measurement. The colors might be sightly different as the difference display,thank you for your understanding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G0QiG-3yL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CQURE","source_asin":"B079BSHWYS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-621545","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079BSHWYS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079BSHWYS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
