window.products.push({"id":621757,"name":"Led Bathroom Mirror 32x24 inch Wall-Mounted Vanity Mirror with High Lumen,Dimmable Touch,Wall Switch Control, Anti-Fog ,CRI 95 Adjustable 3000K-4500K-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rKhswxWaL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"[Dimmable]: Long press the touch button,the light is available to be adjusted from 10% - 100% of brightness.Also you can short press to select 3000K warm white, 4500K neutral white light or 6000K daylight.Comfortable visual lighting, no flicker, no UV. [Unique design]: The mirror power switch and anti-fog switch are all-in-one design. This built in anti-fogging function means no need to constantly treat your mirrors with fog free spray.The anti-fog function will be turned off automatically in one hour,safe and energy-saving. [Safe&lifetime]: UL-listed electronic parts, and covered by safety housing. LED lifetime: over 50,000 hours (Using the mirror 3 hours a day means it will last 45 YEARS), Copper-free Silver Mirror ,much less corrosion rate compared with normal silver mirrors. [Support Wall Switch Control]: wall switch can directly control the light ON/OFF.When the led mirror is powered off and restarted by wall switch, the last use state is restored. [Packaging & easy installation]: Newly improved packing greatly reduces damage during transportation. GENRRYHOME led mirrors have passed all tests including dropping test, impact test, heavy pressure test etc. Screw mount included, easy to install.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rKhswxWaL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GENRRYHOME","source_asin":"B09CYKCHSJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-621757","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CYKCHSJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CYKCHSJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":621758,"name":"VVZ Bed Pillows for Sleeping 2 Pack, Down Alternative Pillows King Size Set of 2, Soft Hotel Collection Gel Pillows for Side and Back Sleepers, Gusset","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qtY8is1XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOFT YET SUPPORTIVE: These pillows for sleeping are super soft and fluffy, yet supportive enough to hold your head and neck for a comfortable night’s sleep. An ideal blend of support and comfort for back, side or stomach sleepers. Greatly help to reduce neck pain and shoulder stiffness. Now days of flipping and punching your pillow in the middle of the night are over. NO MORE FLATTENING & CLUMPING: Filled with the latest Germany-imported 7-hole fibers, these pillows king size set of 2 still retain its original shape and not go flat after a long time of use. After one day’s sleep, the fill is still evenly distributed and doesn’t shift or clump together during the night, and springs back quickly from where your head lay. LUXURIOUS & ACCESSIBLE: The simple but classy pattern on the outer shell gives these 2 king size pillows a luxury deluxe hotel collection pillow feel. The features of side gussets and piping on edges make it keep its shape and fluff up more fully without the drop-off on the edges found on most pillows. FIVE-STAR SLEEPING EXPERIENCE: These bed pillows are very fluffy but your head doesn't get submerged when you lay on them, nor does it elevate your neck a lot like other memory foam pillows. It’s encased with a super soft and breathable outer pillow case. Its quick moisture-wicking ability gives you a breathable and comfy sleeping environment. YOU NEED THIS PILLOW: Start your day refreshed! Sleep comfortably with the gentle softness of these polyester fiber pillows. We are pretty sure that our cozy supportive side sleeper pillow will exceed your expectations! Get yourself one of these comfy gel pillows if you're in the market. You won't be sorry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qtY8is1XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VVZ","source_asin":"B09SBZ19Z3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-621758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SBZ19Z3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SBZ19Z3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
