window.products.push({"id":621807,"name":"Triangle Germany Tomato Knife, Professional-grade 4\" Serrated Wavy Blade, Ice-hardened HC Stainless Steel, Slices Through Soft-skinned Fruits and Vege","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CC29biGmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Marketed worldwide, Triangle Germany stands for high-quality and functional kitchen tools for professional chefs and ambitious home cooks With its unique professional-grade 4\" serrated blade, the Triangle Germany Tomato Knife is specialized for cutting and slicing delicate and pressure-sensitive foods without compression, such as small tomatoes and citrus fruits, and also functions as a paring knife for creating garnishes. Made from premium high-carbon alloy stainless steel from Solingen, Germany, the ice hardened blade is sharp, strong and durable. A hand-polished serrated edge allows for maximum precision and a straight cut. A well-balanced, lightweight handle facilitates simple maneuvering and control and a contoured shape provides a secure and comfortable grip. The polypropylene handle is seamlessly attached to the blade for easy cleaning. Made in Solingen, Germany, the Triangle Germany Kitchen Utility Knife measures 9\" long with a 4\" blade and 5\" handle. For best results and to extend the life of your knife, hand washing is recommended. Food and dishwasher safe. To prevent damage to the blade when sharpening, use only a special sharpener designed specifically for a serrated blade. In 1946, Erwin Hill founded \"Hill Metal Fabrication\" and started manufacturing rotary whisks from a patented design. Over the years, the product range increased, encompassing a wide range of kitchen tools, and the Triangle brand was registered in 2002. Working closely with local partners in Solingen, Germany, to deliver excellent on-the-job stainless steel manufacturing, Triangle is a third-generation family-owned company committed to quality, functionality and sustainable production.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CC29biGmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"triangle","source_asin":"B00CL98M8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-621807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CL98M8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CL98M8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
