window.products.push({"id":621864,"name":"Model S-5 High Efficiency Smoke-Free Fireplace Grate 21\" Wide, 12\" Tall.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sBQNwAuLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One of the most innovative fireplace grates ever - made right here in the USA! These unusual grates will change the way you feel about your woodburning fireplace - just take a look at the following benefits of our amazing Grate Wall of Fire! The Grate Wall of Fire features a unique, patented ember chamber, which prevents drafts from entering beneath the fire (as with other grates.) The ember bed, which is the greatest heat source of a fire, is turned toward you, radiating its heat outwards into the room. No more of this valuable heat flies out of the chimney! Smoke is virtually eliminated! No more risk of a burning log rolling out of the fireplace. Logs are completely burned, leaving a nice, neat pile of ashes. The Grate Wall of Fire offers a dramatic reduction of wood consumption and pesky 'spark popping fires.' The narrow column of embers is held at the rear of the fireplace - this is why the fire never accelerates as wildly as fires do in conventional grates. When burning in the Grate Wall, the wood burns completely without fire-tending in a gravitational, nearly automated fashion, resulting in a steady, heat-efficient fire. After the coal bed is achieved (about an hour or two of burning), only one log an hour will keep a great, cozy fire burning away!The S-Series Grate Wall of Fire grates are perfect for zero-clearance fireplaces.S-5 Specifications:Height: 12\"Width: 21\" Depth: 11\"Weight: 23 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sBQNwAuLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grate Wall of Fire","source_asin":"B003NB1TUI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-621864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003NB1TUI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003NB1TUI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
